{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4b780e576d545718cdc2619d6209e8f3dad5ac2ab5ec2627dd6f7d64107062a", "ja": "（今日は雪歩が出演するCMの、撮影に来ている。\n……が、現場の空気があまりよくない……）", "zh": "（今天来拍雪步演出的广告。\n……可是，现场的气氛不太好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f8726eac960da1cd6fe13803738a0bd5e4d1f7bebd18c12949369b3c073dbd81", "ja": "あ、あうぅ……。", "zh": "啊、啊呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d27e6dec84dcd5ce1c5ada3dc9c81a7ccc22fa83a26cb56b04b1c1479d9cf832", "ja": "雪歩、お疲れさま。\nごめんな、もうちょっと待機しててくれ。", "zh": "雪步，辛苦了。\n不好意思，要麻烦你再稍等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4a7138037bf8d8a2acd885f15402e04904c2daafc724960e040a49632750f491", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　お疲れさまです。\nえっと、それは大丈夫なんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！辛苦了。\n那个，要等是没有问题，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8d0e547d06544481e430ee87834ef17d25f9c34ec4e95bec9f4c1c4b1ef645b8", "ja": "あの、みなさん険しい表情で……、\nなんだか、ちょっと怖いですぅ……。", "zh": "那个，大家看上去都好严肃……\n感觉有点吓人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fc43cb10ce3ab8b96feff5ed57a9e3e6dc793f7f8961e481fe1b0b9579d3455e", "ja": "ああ……細かいミスが続いて、時間が押してるって。\n撮影スタッフみんな、ピリピリしてるみたいだ。", "zh": "这个啊……因为一直有小差错，所以压缩到时间。\n摄影人员现在都很紧绷的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a825d0cd774e5e367d823b46d1ddc525ec053a03f30f76da44eda1de504c9b3e", "ja": "ミスですか？　全然わからなかったですけど……。\n時間も、そんなに遅れていないような……。", "zh": "差错吗？我都没发现……\n而且时间上好像也没晚多久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bdafa96c04e8ea27732e4a032312380ea7836a9ab4b08f23494f90ed67e37da9", "ja": "まあ、妥協を許さないスタッフ達なんだろう。\nありがたいことなんだけど……まいったな。", "zh": "嗯，我想是工作人员都追求完美吧。\n这样是很好没错，不过……也有点伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2cf3c618fcb205e4ce29f6195f8e3c8f83cd4dea678d285eb4653c2386304681", "ja": "……。\nあの、{$P$}。", "zh": "……\n那个，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1930d2276c51ab2f5f80840962c01896624fae1c0a9ce99fe5edd3383bc18161", "ja": "この撮影所って、給湯室ありましたよね？\nちょっと借りられたりしますか？", "zh": "我记得这个摄影棚有茶水间对吧？\n方便借用一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7aa32d5bbc5d17f42b5b8cf98c9254e5f8d7b4886399cd471ff2282b3aa8c733", "ja": "え？　ああ、設備は好きに使っていいって\n言われてるけど……どうするんだ？", "zh": "咦？是可以啦，对方有说这里的设施都能自由使用，\n不过……你要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8ea230fb63990805694f0664bc4635541d75ba601fc07c0024f374d3abe12426", "ja": "はい。私、お茶っ葉を持ってきているので、\nみなさんにお茶を淹れようかなって……。", "zh": "嗯，我有带茶叶过来，\n想泡个茶请大家喝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "044aa80f21c03a639421c398c59179cb635fb74144baff20dbae0f9a4060ff58", "ja": "急がなきゃいけないのは、わかりますけど。\nそういうときこそ、リラックスが必要だと思うんです。", "zh": "我知道现在在赶时间，\n但越是这样，感觉才更需要让大家喘口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "09088acd09cfcd7db72cdbf0074ea372dac6faeac145fd934c27f49c9db1bbcc", "ja": "おいしいお茶でほっと一息ついたら、お仕事も\nうまくいくんじゃないかなって……ど、どうでしょう？", "zh": "我想说喝口好喝的茶休息一下，\n工作或许会更顺利……这、这点子怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cca4e2caf31d1be1c3c36fb014cfdcc6e3afe220f7610a3a62fd00dba547629f", "ja": "なるほど！　いいかもしれない。\nさっそく監督に提案してみよう。", "zh": "这样啊！好像不错呢。\n马上去跟导演提议吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6acd587bc2a42516024d74cc47348c4ae6d2f85a944d919ce30ca61c12fa6cd1", "ja": "は、はいっ！　あの、で、でも、\nひとりで行くのはちょっと怖いので……。", "zh": "好、好的！那个，可、可是，\n我自己去会怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "df77599976274e49f2667429a06b081d060f1b4c4e1e60ff6374c72e4070cd4f", "ja": "{$P$}、\n一緒に来てくれますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你愿意陪我一起去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f2ecfd4bc06fb7433e5464251c42a063f8b7d358dac0c28d3994a9881e6c660d", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　一緒に行こう。", "zh": "嗯，当然好啊！我们一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "044b07633739df34eed2ae809cccf3ef884d559d98333bfbde79d7d60af22eaf", "ja": "み、みなさん、お茶が入りましたぁ。\nよかったら、どうぞ……！", "zh": "各、各位，我泡了茶。\n不介意的话，请用……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8f384964786c6a76230734faaf19db00e9cdfc8083ca182c58ddf6a1056639cc", "ja": "（雪歩のお茶で、現場は一転、和やかムードに。\n自分から提案して、声をかけるなんて……）", "zh": "（雪步的热茶让现场气氛一下就变得温和许多。\n没想到她居然会主动提出这点子，还跟大家搭话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6cea7a1ac7f863ca4a1a1810125cd0bd7616858d95af4bf52dac76bac80a5035", "ja": "みなさんに喜んでもらえて、嬉しいですぅ。\n{$P$}の分も、おいしく淹れますね♪", "zh": "看大家开心，我也很高兴。我也有准备\n{$P$}的份，这就泡好喝的茶给你喝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1021_womanstaff", "source_sha256": "f4765d980f1135cc9a0b09fff705c12acb7059b1f4125d949a366d350fe24f6d", "ja": "萩原さん、ありがとうございますっ！\nこのお茶、すごくおいしいです！", "zh": "萩原小姐，非常谢谢你！\n你泡的茶真的很好喝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0972307119c3b0809146ff3f4ab4ea7878a05cc3b92088b130321be3a3d51208", "ja": "あっ、はい、よかったですぅ……！\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "啊，嗯，太好了……！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "91c76e21b2725b051262eb3ff3215881d1bbdd779579ffacbef34cd3768f6943", "ja": "（これなら撮影も順調に進みそうだ！\n……雪歩、成長したな！）", "zh": "（看这样子，拍摄也能顺利进行了！\n……雪步，你长大了呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1024_malestaff", "source_sha256": "955a5080592337469869c92c578795fe0a2101d7a1a22880c99f5dc7c46bd4df", "ja": "いや～、萩原さん！　実は僕、ファンなんですよ！\n萩原さんのお茶が飲めるなんて、幸せだなぁ！", "zh": "哎呀～荻原小姐！其实我是你的粉丝！\n居然能喝到你亲手泡的茶，我真是太幸福了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f1fef1d56801c1b5152359a1484d023aeea76b99a4a2d72e00439828ce7da788", "ja": "ひいっ！？　は、はいぃ……！", "zh": "咦！？不、不客气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0104_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5a7c0566a791b5183b26ba678c62b0ba95d8cb8bd164e20db7a62aab3be813f1", "ja": "（……これからも、がんばっていこうな！）", "zh": "（……接下来也要继续加油啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
